{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32897","headline":"晚泊松江驿 · 李郢","name":"晚泊松江驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片帆孤客晚夷犹，红蓼花前水驿秋。\n岁月方惊离别尽，烟波仍驻古今愁。\n云阴故国山川暮，潮落空江网罟收。\n还有吴娃旧歌曲，櫂声遥散采菱舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}